<h1>Re: {{subject}}</h1>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>The GateML support team has replied to your message.</p>

<div class="highlight">
  <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px;color:#9ca3af;">Support reply:</p>
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#e5e5e5;white-space:pre-line;">{{replyBody}}</p>
</div>

<p>If you need further help, reply to this email or submit a new message from your dashboard.</p>

<p style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0;">
  <a class="btn" href="{{dashboardUrl}}/support">View Support History</a>
</p>

<hr class="divider" />
<p style="font-size:13px;color:#555;">Reference ID: <span class="code">{{messageId}}</span></p>
